---
question: How do I make an order?
order: 2
---
We cook fortnightly on Fridays during school term times (most of the chefs have children to look after). You can order [here](/order) and pay on PayPal, or email us on [ammiskitchensheffield@gmail.com](mailto:ammiskitchensheffield@gmail.com) and pay on pick up by cash or card. We take orders up until 5pm on the Tuesday before we cook.
